<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan T-bills yields fall.</title>
<headline>Moldovan T-bills yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 22.54 percent on Tuesday from 23.89 percent at the previous auction on April 15, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.51 percent from 27.88 percent on April 15 and the yield on 182-day T-bills fell to 28.65 percent from 29.18 percent on April 1.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    April 22	   April 15</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 2.82 million	   2.99 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 million	   2.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    22.54 pct	  23.89 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.3 pct	   98.2 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.3-98.5 pct    98.2-98.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 May 22, 1997     May 15, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    April 22	   April 15</p>
<p> Issue volume		   19 million lei	 18.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 41.29 million	  26.13 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    19.00 million	  18.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    26.51 pct	  27.88 pct</p>
<p> Price			    93.8 pct	   93.5 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  93.8-94.2 pct    93.5-94.3 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 July 24, 1997    July 17, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-days paper auction:</p>
<p>				    April 22	   April 1</p>
<p> Issue volume		   4.00 million lei     3.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 8.97 million	   2.52 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    4.00 million	   2.1 million</p>
<p> Yield			    28.65 pct	  29.18 pct</p>
<p> Price			    87.5 pct	   87.3 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  87.5-88.5 pct    87.3-97.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Oct 23, 1997     Oct 2, 1997</p>
